==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Molduga Fins are [[Monster Part]]s than are obtained by defeating [[Molduga]]. They can be used with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] or used as an ingredient for [[Gray Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

The [[Sand Boots]] require Molduga Fins in order to be upgraded to their first and second tiers at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
